## 4. TEMPLATES (TWIG)

### 4.1 Back-Office: `templates/back/projects/list.html.twig`
- Extends `back/_base.html.twig`
- Displays projects in a **sortable, searchable table** with columns: Name, Status (color-coded badges), Start Date, End Date, Budget
- **Client-side search** (instant filter as you type in a search input)
- **Client-side column sorting** (click column headers to sort ASC/DESC with arrow icons)
- **Delete confirmation modal** (custom modal with blur backdrop, not browser `confirm()`)
- Status badges use CSS classes: `bo-badge-success` (DONE), `bo-badge-primary` (IN_PROGRESS), `bo-badge-danger` (ON_HOLD), `bo-badge-warning` (PLANNED)
- "Nouveau projet" button links to `admin_project_new`
- Each row has Edit and Delete action buttons

### 4.2 Back-Office: `templates/back/projects/form.html.twig`
- Extends `back/_base.html.twig`
- **Dual-purpose**: creates new project OR edits existing (checks `project` variable)
- **Real-time client-side validation** with visual feedback:
  - Name field: validates ≥ 2 chars, shows green check or red X with messages
  - Date fields: validates endDate ≥ startDate
  - Budget field: validates ≥ 0
  - Submit button is **disabled until form is valid** (opacity transition)
  - Fields get green/red borders (`field-valid` / `field-invalid` CSS classes)
- When editing, shows an **activity panel on the right side** (col-lg-5):
  - Lists all activities for this project
  - Has an **inline form to add a new activity** directly from the project page (posts to `admin_project_activity_new`)
  - Activity form has its own mini-validation (description required)
  - Each activity shows: description, date, hours worked

### 4.3 Back-Office: `templates/back/activities/list.html.twig`
- Extends `back/_base.html.twig`
- **Split layout**: left side = assignment form (col-lg-5), right side = activity list (col-lg-7)
- **Assignment form** with:
  - Candidate dropdown (from `candidates` variable — CANDIDATE role users)
  - Project dropdown (optional, from `projects` variable)
  - Description textarea (required, min 5 chars)
  - Date picker (defaults to today)
  - Hours worked input (numeric, min 0)
  - Full client-side validation (same green/red feedback pattern)
  - Submit button disabled until valid
- **Activity list** with:
  - Card-style items showing description, employee email, project name, hours, date
  - **Client-side search** filter
  - Real-time count update

### 4.4 Front-Office: `templates/front/account/activities.html.twig`
- Extends `front/_base.html.twig`
- **Employee's personal activity view** (candidates see their own assigned activities)
- **Summary stats row** with 3 cards:
  - Total activities count
  - Total hours worked (summed in Twig)
  - Number of distinct projects linked
- **Activity list**: each activity is a card showing description, project badge, hours badge, date
- Icon changes based on whether activity has a project linked or not
- Empty state message when no activities

