## 5. CLIENT-SIDE JAVASCRIPT FEATURES

### 5.1 Project List (`list.html.twig`)
- **Instant search**: filters table rows by any text content as user types
- **Column sorting**: click any column header to sort ASC/DESC. Handles text, dates (via `data-date` attribute), and numbers (via `data-num` attribute). Sort direction indicator with Bootstrap Icons arrows.
- **Delete modal**: custom overlay modal with `backdrop-filter: blur(4px)`, click-outside-to-close

### 5.2 Project Form (`form.html.twig`)
