- **State machine**: tracks validity of each field (`state = {name: false, dates: true, budget: true}`), submit button enables only when all valid
- **Activity mini-form**: same validation pattern for the inline activity creation form

### 5.3 Activity List (`list.html.twig`)
- **Form validation**: validates candidate selection, description (min 5 chars), hours (≥ 0)
- **Instant search**: filters activity cards by text content

